        "id": 19759,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-03-03T21:52:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The Punishment ability from Relic allows you to treat a penalty as if it were a bonus when you attack the enemy that gave it to you.&nbsp; What happens if you have multiple penalties from multiple enemies and you attack all of them with the same die?&nbsp; Do they all turn into bonuses?&nbsp; Or is the effect die modified selectively for each target?</p>\n<p>Also, when you use Frontline Fighting (Physical Powerhouse), does the target have to use the basic \"Attack\" action or any Attack action?&nbsp; I'd infer that \"<em>the</em> Attack action\" instead of \"<em>an</em>&nbsp;Attack action\" means basic attacks only, but if so, this would shut down villains hard.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:34.058Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
        "reads": 1,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 10.2,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 19759,
        "topic_slug": "quick-ability-questions",
        "display_username": "MindWanderer",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
