        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>The Punishment ability from Relic allows you to treat a penalty as if it were a bonus when you attack the enemy that gave it to you.&nbsp; What happens if you have multiple penalties from multiple enemies and you attack all of them with the same die?&nbsp; Do they all turn into bonuses?&nbsp; Or is the effect die modified selectively for each target?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also, when you use Frontline Fighting (Physical Powerhouse), does the target have to use the basic \"Attack\" action or any Attack action?&nbsp; I'd infer that \"<em>the</em> Attack action\" instead of \"<em>an</em>&nbsp;Attack action\" means basic attacks only, but if so, this would shut down villains hard.</p>",
