        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>For the multiple enemies + Punishment question, I would say that the die is modified selectively for each target.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For Frontline Fighting, since it does not specify a 'basic Attack action', I believe that the target can still use abilities. Their action(s) on their turn&nbsp;just need&nbsp;to include an Attack on/involving the user of Frontline Fighting</p>",
